    {
      "id": "10000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000100",
      "name": "Note",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Landing.jobs Scraper\n\nRemote backend roles from the Landing.jobs public REST API (`GET /api/v1/jobs`, JSON, no auth).\n\n**Schedule:** Every 15 minutes\n**Source:** `landingjobs`\n\n1. Get criteria from Job Hunter API\n2. Fetch all open jobs (one page)\n3. Keep jobs whose tags match a tracked category\n4. Normalize & send to /jobs/ingest",
